## Context
SYNC.md §Mechanics, carried by no ticket until now (review-implementation.md
§5.4): five drivers hardcode ZOTEUS_SEARCH_BACKEND (query.py, run_serve.py,
run_serve2.py, and the recorded env in results/json-baseline/emit.py);
upstream's knob is ZOTEUS_INDEX_BACKEND=auto|sqlite|memory. Until the rename
lands, any re-measurement silently measures `auto` and reports whatever the
flag said. One line per driver. Precondition for X2 and X4 re-measurement
(0025).

## Exit criteria
- [ ] all five drivers set ZOTEUS_INDEX_BACKEND explicitly
- [ ] each driver's recorded provenance names the env var it set
